@bank all
// W3, rec deck R12: the News feed's rec dec posts (banks/news.lines' format: one kind per source, 90 characters).
// trad: ids are content/traditions/rec-*.trad's.

== news.trad
? trad:rec-wso
- Winner Stays On at the court from half eleven. Pell has the chalkboard. And the bell.
- Lightdisc today: write your name on Pell's board. Win and you stay on. Simple.
? trad:rec-cup
- Cup day! The Lightdisc Cup bracket is up in the foyer. Cheer for your department.
? trad:rec-dawn-swim
- Dawn swim at quarter past six. Empty lanes and a very awake Rina.
? trad:rec-paddle-club
- Paddle club tonight with Chief Holt. Helmets on. He will check.
? trad:rec-regatta
- Regatta morning! Heats of four from half nine. Officers: the horn, through the floor.
? trad:rec-wall-night
- Wall night: Tomas belays, you climb, the bell rings. The season's board is filling up.
? trad:rec-float-hour
- Float hour tonight in the float room. No talking. Not even a little.
? trad:rec-slow-stretch
- Slow stretch at eight with Dr. Nandakumar. Bring water. She'll ask.
? trad:rec-talent-night
- Talent night! Lucia hosts, Maeve runs the lights. The music room's been busy all week.
? trad:rec-all-hands
- The Captain's all-hands at quarter to six in the auditorium. Then dinner.

? trad:rec-cup
- Lightdisc Cup today. The bracket's in the foyer; the final's after three.
? trad:rec-wren-talk
- A Wren talk tonight at seven on the auditorium stage. Tea, chairs, questions.
? trad:rec-chiefs-talk
- A chief's talk tonight at seven in the auditorium. Bring a question. They remember.
? trad:rec-film-night
- Film night in the auditorium at eight. Popcorn from the galley. The screen's coming down.

== news.works
- Rec deck: pool filter changed. Maeve did it in nine minutes forty. She wants it known.
- Court net back up after a flicker. The Sunday crowd cheered the repair. Works bowed.
- A route's taped off on the climbing wall while a loose hold gets tightened. Sorry, blue.
- Gravity plates checked. The float room is floating exactly as much as it should.

== news.notice
- Rec deck: wet towels in the returns bin, please. Not on the beanbags.
- Kit hire is self-serve. So is putting it back. The sign says so. In capitals.
- Found on the kit hire counter: one flipper. Owner, please collect. It's lonely.
- The rec deck closes at midnight, for Deck 4's sleep. Night swimmers, sorry.
- The season's bell board is in the rec deck foyer. Ring the bell on Wall night to join it.

== news.gossip
- Someone left the float room on "moon" again. We have suspects. We have no proof.
- Chief Holt was seen leaving the float room. Twice. He says it was for his back.
- Overheard on the court: "Pell 11, You banana." The scoreboard needs Works.
- Rina says she's beaten Pell at Lightdisc eleven times. Pell says nine. Ask Rina.

== news.crew
- Commander Vance has rung the climbing wall bell more than anyone. He has the number.
- {name} rang the bell on Wall night. Their name's on the season's board in the foyer.
